596				<h2>Welcome to Accessible HTML5</h2>
597				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
598				<p>
599					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
600					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
601				</p>
602				<p>
603					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
604					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
605				</p>
